cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "ortho-tech-diffusion: tooling for measuring technology research diffusion in orthopaedic literature"
abstract: >-
  Pipeline for measuring the share of orthopaedic surgical literature devoted to
  distinct technology families in MEDLINE/PubMed, 2005-2025. Provides a local mirror
  of the PubMed baseline and update files with MD5 verification, a parallel parser
  producing an analytic denominator table with explicit PubMed/MEDLINE status flags,
  PMID deduplication honouring DeleteCitation, and programmatic expansion of MeSH
  subtrees defining the clinical field. Study protocol in docs/protocol/.
type: software
authors:
